<title>CHINA: China eyes $40 bln foreign investment in 1996.</title>
<headline>China eyes $40 bln foreign investment in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China expects to attract $40 billion in direct foreign investment in 1996, the Financial News said on Tuesday, quoting central bank governor Dai Xianglong.</p>
<p>Direct foreign investment in China totalled $37 billion in 1995, the official newspaper said. It gave no further details.</p>
